1
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,230
I hurt someone again.

2
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:40,130
When will I ever truly control myself?

3
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:46,400
You deserve this.

4
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:11,800
Don't...

5
00:01:12,830 --> 00:01:13,530
Ah!

6
00:01:14,860 --> 00:01:15,730
Don't move.

7
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:26,160
I'm

8
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:28,060
still alive.

9
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:30,330
You are lucky, Madam.

10
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:32,300
Senior Medical Maniac said

11
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:33,100
anyone else

12
00:01:33,130 --> 00:01:34,930
would be pushing up daisies by now.

13
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:35,660
Ye Qifeng,

14
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,460
stop saying such unlucky things
in the ward.

15
00:01:44,330 --> 00:01:45,500
Qiongqi hurt you.

16
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:47,590
I will give you an explanation.

17
00:01:49,430 --> 00:01:50,700
Did he do it on purpose?

18
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:54,830
Qiongqi's true form is a fierce beast.

19
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:56,630
He relies on Buddhist mantras
to suppress his evil nature.

20
00:01:56,630 --> 00:01:57,830
He just returned to Yanmen,

21
00:01:57,830 --> 00:01:58,530
his aura was unstable,

22
00:01:58,530 --> 00:01:59,660
and he mistook you for an intruder,

23
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:00,720
so he lost control.

24
00:02:05,260 --> 00:02:07,460
So he couldn't control himself either.

25
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,419
That's no excuse for hurting you.

26
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:10,430
I know.

27
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:16,360
But I also know

28
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:18,160
what it feels like to be dragged around

29
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:20,090
by something inside your own body.

30
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:23,930
Uncle,

31
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,460
I don't want to just lie here
waiting for someone to protect me.

32
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:27,660
The longer I lie here,
the more I feel like

33
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:29,230
a fragile plate ready to break
at any moment.

34
00:02:29,230 --> 00:02:30,230
If you were a plate, Madam,

35
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:33,030
you'd be the kind
that jumps up and smashes people.

36
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,890
I'll shut up. The medicine is here.

37
00:02:39,530 --> 00:02:41,060
Focus on recovering first.

38
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,630
Didn't you want to know
about the outside world?

39
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:44,560
When you're better,

40
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,690
I'll take you there.

41
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:47,329
Really?

42
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,600
Really.

43
00:02:48,829 --> 00:02:50,000
You're not just going
to carry me out for some sun

44
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,930
and then carry me right back, are you?

45
00:02:51,930 --> 00:02:53,390
Depends on your behavior.

46
00:02:56,329 --> 00:02:56,829
Great.

47
00:02:57,500 --> 00:02:59,560
Sounds like you're going to back out.

48
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,690
Not bad, not bad.

49
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:08,500
Kong is very perceptive.

50
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,420
This prescription is spot on.

51
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,860
It's because I have a good master.

52
00:03:12,860 --> 00:03:13,600
Hahaha.

53
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:16,560
Then I will accept you as my disciple.

54
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:17,000
Yeah.

55
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,430
Our Kong might become

56
00:03:18,430 --> 00:03:20,400
a great doctor in the future.

57
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
In the future.

58
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,600
Don't stay cooped up in the room.

59
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,360
Go out for a walk,

60
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,730
you'll recover faster.

61
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:29,030
Senior Medical Maniac,

62
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:29,730
am I right?

63
00:03:30,130 --> 00:03:30,800
Go ahead.

64
00:03:35,460 --> 00:03:35,960
Sister,

65
00:03:36,230 --> 00:03:36,960
three more steps

66
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,620
and this candied haw is yours.

67
00:03:39,660 --> 00:03:42,500
Bai, if you talk to me in that tone again,

68
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:45,000
the first thing I'll do
when I recover is make fish soup.

69
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,800
Here you go, my wise and mighty sister

70
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,460
who is already 80% recovered.

71
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:51,200
So sweet.

72
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:52,900
It's good to be alive.

73
00:03:56,230 --> 00:03:57,490
I'm here to apologize.

74
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,090
If you want to punish me,

75
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:00,400
you can do it anytime.

76
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:05,230
Wait.

77
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,660
I'm still afraid of you right now.

78
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:17,760
But I also know
you didn't do it on purpose.

79
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,660
When I'm no longer afraid,

80
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,459
I'll decide how to punish you.

81
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,600
All right.

82
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,360
Everyone in the Yan Sect is protecting me.

83
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,490
But why do I want to go out more and more?

84
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,030
Madam,

85
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:37,130
the Sect Leader ordered that

86
00:04:37,130 --> 00:04:38,000
you cannot leave the courtyard

87
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,500
until you are fully healed.

88
00:04:39,500 --> 00:04:41,230
I just want to take a look at the streets.

89
00:04:41,230 --> 00:04:43,360
The Sect Leader said last time
you were just asking for directions,

90
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,730
but ended up in the Qiongqi Courtyard.

91
00:04:44,730 --> 00:04:46,130
And the time before that,
you were just taking a walk,

92
00:04:46,130 --> 00:04:47,100
but ended up by the Cold Pool.

93
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:47,560
Sister,

94
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:48,560
your 'just'

95
00:04:48,730 --> 00:04:50,190
is usually more than that.

96
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:51,630
Whose side are you on?

97
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,830
The side of candied haws.

98
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:58,330
He said he would take me out
when I'm healed.

99
00:04:58,330 --> 00:04:59,860
But I'd be waiting forever

100
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,730
for him to keep his word.

101
00:05:06,730 --> 00:05:08,500
I'm just going out to buy a candied haw,

102
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,030
see the market, and relax.

103
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,360
I won't cause trouble.

104
00:05:17,930 --> 00:05:19,030
Safety first,

105
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:20,100
running away second,

106
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:21,200
eating third.

107
00:05:23,300 --> 00:05:23,660
No,

108
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:25,660
eating should be second.

109
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,159
Running away from home
before fully healing

110
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:42,020
is indeed quite unprofessional.

111
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,730
But I can't always wait

112
00:05:43,730 --> 00:05:45,930
for others to dictate how I live my life.

113
00:05:48,860 --> 00:05:49,700
Candied haws!

114
00:05:49,830 --> 00:05:51,230
Delicious candied haws!

115
00:05:51,330 --> 00:05:52,130
Give me a stick.

116
00:05:52,130 --> 00:05:53,659
Here you go, Young Master.

117
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,460
By disguising myself as a man,

118
00:05:58,460 --> 00:05:59,720
I finally sneaked out.

119
00:05:59,930 --> 00:06:01,430
It's just as Bai said.

120
00:06:01,430 --> 00:06:03,290
The outside world is so bustling.

121
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:06,360
What is this place?

122
00:06:07,330 --> 00:06:08,860
It looks so grand.

123
00:06:10,730 --> 00:06:12,600
There must be a lot of
delicious food inside.
